                <zone fixed-size='299' forceUpdate='true' h='33778' id='83' type-v2='text' w='37358' x='59428' y='58222'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#14213d' fontsize='13'>How to read this page?</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Each cell compares a vehicle&apos;s weekly MPG with its own previous 8 weeks.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Red = worse than normal. Blue = better.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>The list shows changes beyond 25%.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Fix the vehicle with the biggest drop first. A repeat red streak (like V-005) points to a real problem, not a one-off week.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
